  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5025.01 Marine Display Requirements. All marine displays of fireworks shall be in accordance with this section and NFPA 1123, Code for Display Fireworks, 2014 edition, available as noted in Appendix B, and this section.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95; ss by #7481, eff 4-25-01, EXPIRED: 4-25-01\n\nNew. #9471, INTERIM, eff 5-15-09, EXPIRED: 11-11-09\n\nNew. #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17",
